{"file": "D:\\SpaceBook\\_cls7_jpg\\hist\\083.jpg", "lines": [{"text": "Unit:05 The Mughal Empire", "conf": 0.869, "box": [[372, 93], [562, 95], [562, 115], [372, 113]]}, {"text": "Foundation of The Mughal Empire", "conf": 0.875, "box": [[72, 108], [476, 127], [474, 160], [70, 141]]}, {"text": "disintegrated into a collection ofsmall kingdoms.", "conf": 0.904, "box": [[75, 258], [489, 272], [488, 299], [74, 284]]}, {"text": "the establishment of the Mughal Empire and its legacy.", "conf": 0.948, "box": [[73, 309], [534, 324], [533, 354], [72, 339]]}, {"text": "Punjab", "conf": 0.742, "box": [[368, 439], [411, 439], [411, 453], [368, 453]]}, {"text": "Bengal", "conf": 0.81, "box": [[673, 565], [730, 565], [730, 579], [673, 579]]}, {"text": "Gonchrana", "conf": 0.746, "box": [[570, 589], [634, 589], [634, 603], [570, 603]]}, {"text": "Or", "conf": 0.637, "box": [[679, 609], [699, 609], [699, 621], [679, 621]]}, {"text": "Golkonda", "conf": 0.849, "box": [[562, 643], [618, 643], [618, 656], [562, 656]]}, {"text": "az", "conf": 0.654, "box": [[233, 706], [314, 664], [332, 701], [251, 742]]}, {"text": "MiughalEmpire", "conf": 0.839, "box": [[191, 759], [290, 762], [290, 772], [191, 769]]}, {"text": "Palabakkarars", "conf": 0.865, "box": [[551, 761], [644, 761], [644, 776], [551, 776]]}, {"text": "1530DenthorBabur", "conf": 0.858, "box": [[223, 777], [349, 781], [349, 797], [222, 794]]}, {"text": "1605DeathofAkbar", "conf": 0.882, "box": [[224, 801], [347, 803], [347, 817], [224, 815]]}, {"text": "1707DeathofAurangzeb", "conf": 0.878, "box": [[222, 821], [375, 824], [375, 841], [222, 838]]}, {"text": "ZahiruddinMuhammad Babur", "conf": 0.887, "box": [[78, 851], [420, 860], [419, 884], [78, 876]]}, {"text": "Thefounder of theMughalEmpire was Zahiruddin Muhammad Babur(1526AD-1530AD).", "conf": 0.912, "box": [[77, 889], [827, 901], [827, 927], [77, 915]]}, {"text": "Babur was a brilliant general who descended from both Taimur and Genghis Khan.Babur", "conf": 0.907, "box": [[78, 915], [828, 928], [828, 952], [78, 938]]}, {"text": "achieved somemajor successes against Ibrahim Lodhi,Afghans,Rajputs and founded the", "conf": 0.903, "box": [[78, 940], [830, 954], [830, 978], [78, 965]]}, {"text": "MughalEmpire.", "conf": 0.849, "box": [[79, 966], [223, 969], [223, 992], [79, 989]]}, {"text": "Consolidation of theMughal Empire", "conf": 0.918, "box": [[79, 999], [490, 1007], [489, 1034], [79, 1025]]}, {"text": "By 1529 AD, Babur successfully conquered the major parts of northern India and began", "conf": 0.934, "box": [[80, 1033], [834, 1048], [834, 1075], [80, 1061]]}, {"text": "consolidating the Mughal Empire.The boundaries for the Mughal Empire weredefined by", "conf": 0.918, "box": [[79, 1058], [834, 1073], [834, 1100], [79, 1085]]}, {"text": "the natural topography of the Subcontinent. Babur also made some of the following", "conf": 0.929, "box": [[79, 1081], [837, 1097], [837, 1127], [79, 1110]]}, {"text": "important efforts to developan efficient administrationof the Empire:", "conf": 0.905, "box": [[80, 1108], [673, 1119], [672, 1145], [80, 1134]]}]}